      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not trying to be difficult but i really dont think this is an emergency. it just feels like one of those massive migraines that happens once every few years. if i go to the er i'll just be sitting in a waiting room for 6 hours and wasting money. i really just want to know if 100mg of sumatriptan is gonna hurt me long term since i've taken it before. can you just be straight with me, is taking two 50mg pills actually a big deal? i just want to be able to sleep off this headache.",
